WEBVTT

00:28:58.208 --> 00:29:02.559
And for me, this is a referendum
on the American experiment.

00:29:02.583 --> 00:29:05.476
On whether we really believe,

00:29:05.500 --> 00:29:06.750
and ...

00:29:08.375 --> 00:29:09.976
the future is in our hands.

00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:11.684
And this is not like other crises,

00:29:11.708 --> 00:29:14.559
I've been the head of the ACLU
for almost 20 years,

00:29:14.583 --> 00:29:16.601
I feel like I've seen it all.

00:29:16.625 --> 00:29:18.625
This is different.

00:29:19.625 --> 00:29:23.059
And this is different
because it is cumulative,

00:29:23.083 --> 00:29:26.018
like Phil and Rashad and Dr. King told us,

00:29:26.042 --> 00:29:29.976
this is centuries
of systemic discrimination,

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:31.893
and the bill has come due.